UNAPPLIED patch sketch: optional max-speed conditioning input for maxspeed
PatchPolicy engines (see docs/serving_max_speed.md). Target: yaak-ai/drivr
branch feat/configurable-decode-strategies @ ae755b4. Semantics: float km/h
per frame, -1 = unlimited, NaN / --max-speed unset = UNKNOWN (the model's
trained missing-map mode). Engines without the binding are legacy and are
fed nothing (PR#27 derived-not-configured pattern).
